==Location comparison==
=== Wyrmscraig ===
All three variants of wyrms can be found on [[Wyrmscraig]], making it the most versatile location for completing a wyrms task. The island requires level 62 [[Sailing]] to access. Before partially completing [[Fallen From Grace]], only the wyrmlings on the island's surface are accessible; completing the required portions of the quest unlocks access to the [[Wyrmscraig Cavern]], where adult wyrms and Lava Strykewyrms can be found. Full completion of the quest also unlocks a [[Chest pieces (Wyrmscraig)|buildable bank]], as well as teleportation to the island via the [[slayer ring]] and [[necklace of passage]], making completion of Fallen From Grace necessary to take full advantage of the location.

Wyrmlings can be found in the wyrmling nest on the island's surface. This is the recommended location for quickly completing a wyrms task as the wyrmlings have lower health, reside in a [[multicombat area]] where a [[dwarf multicannon]] can be used, and are close to a bank and the [[Necklace of passage#Teleportation options|necklace of passage]] teleport.

Adult wyrms and Lava Strykewyrms can both be found in the [[Wyrmscraig Cavern]] which can be easily reached using the slayer ring teleport. The cavern is a [[single-way combat]] area, but a multicannon can be used to draw [[Aggressiveness|aggression]] from the adult wyrms, providing a faster and lower-effort method of killing them than at other locations. Although a multicannon can be set up near the [[Lava Strykewyrm|Lava Strykewyrms]], they are immune to cannon damage.

=== Karuulm Slayer Dungeon ===
Adult wyrms are also found in the [[Karuulm Slayer Dungeon]]. Unless the elite tier of the [[Kourend & Kebos Diary]] has been completed, players must wear [[boots of stone]], [[boots of brimstone]], or [[granite boots]] to prevent taking rapid damage from the overheated floor.

=== Earthbound Cavern ===
Wyrmlings are also found in the [[Earthbound Cavern]] in [[Neypotzli]]. This location requires partial completion of [[Perilous Moons]] to access and is generally not recommended due to its distance from a bank and lack of convenient transportation methods. However, Neypotzl is a convenient location for players who don't wish to use their own supplies as they can use resources within the cavern to sustain their trip.

=== Charred Dungeon ===
Lava Strykewyrms are also found in the [[Charred Dungeon]] on [[Charred Island]]. This location requires level 60 [[Sailing]]{{Boostable|n}} to access.
